[{"title":"雨竹","author":"朱朴","text":"寂寞古墙根，苍苔半掩门。\n幽人独未寝，疏雨滴黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21995,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夕","author":"朱朴","text":"出门望南山，日夕山光冷。\n山月出未高，栖鸦动林影。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21996,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再吟","author":"朱朴","text":"林空落叶乾，石瘦苔花冷。\n嘿行观道心，碧涧流云影。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21997,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒坐","author":"朱朴","text":"偶来看青山，因对白云坐。\n此意同一閒，青山白云我。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21998,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独步","author":"朱朴","text":"无树不秋色，有时闻鸟声。\n村深山路迮，人在涧边行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21999,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小庄","author":"朱朴","text":"莫谓村庄小，田园岂在多。\n平泉与金谷，生事近如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22000,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋色","author":"朱朴","text":"秋水可鉴貌，晚山宜放船。\n绝怜江浦上，好景夕阳边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe