6d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和西皋送春三首 其一","author":"朱朴","text":"来日流莺至，去日落花深。\n青春自来去，莺花伤客心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22008,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和西皋送春三首 其二","author":"朱朴","text":"南浦送春去，绿波江可怜。\n萋萋三百里，愁共草连天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22009,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和西皋送春三首 其三","author":"朱朴","text":"春归人送春，春去亦催人。\n眼见辛夷发，飘为陌上尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22010,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"俞江村出二景为题 其一","author":"朱朴","text":"一间两间茆屋，三树五树桃花。\n借问先生何处，钱塘江上人家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22011,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"俞江村出二景为题 其二","author":"朱朴","text":"千顷黄云未割，数峰残雨初收。\n白雁度江南去，丹枫随水东流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22012,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖竹枝词五首 其一","author":"朱朴","text":"湖头春水绿于苔，滉漾绿酒浮金杯。\n瞰湖楼子知多少，扇扇红帘影倒开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22013,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖竹枝词五首 二","author":"朱朴","text":"谁家女儿金缕衣，银瓶